cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FlowPDE in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FlowPDE: Flow-based Generative Models for PDEs"
abstract: >-
  FlowPDE is a PyTorch library for learning conditional distributions between
  PDE fields. It combines flow matching with neural ODEs to solve forward and
  inverse problems, with Exponax-based Poisson, Burgers and Darcy datasets.
authors:
  - family-names: Yurtseven
    given-names: Sarper
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarperyn/FlowPDE"
url: "https://sarperyn.github.io/FlowPDE/"
keywords:
  - partial differential equations
  - flow matching
  - neural ODE
  - generative models
  - inverse problems
  - scientific machine learning
  - pytorch
